==Trivia==
*Since [[Lumbridge]] is based on the real life city of {{Wp|Cambridge}}, England, the real life analog of Duke Horacio would be the {{Wp|Duke of Cambridge}}. This title was extinct when ''RuneScape'' was released, but has since been given to {{Wp|Prince William}}.
*After completing the [[2020 Birthday event]], a [[Horacio (2020 Birthday event)|variant]] form of Duke Horacio could be found attending the party.
*A [[Duke Horacio (2021 Birthday event)|variant]] form of Duke Horacio was involved in the [[2021 Birthday event]], during which the player had to help the duke capture a number of monkeys distributed around Lumbridge.

